            <ArticleTitle>[Postradiation and postchemotherapy complications in patients with urinary bladder cancer].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>32-5</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>A comparison was made of chemoradiation lesions of lower urinary tract mucosa in urinary bladder (UB) cancer at stage T1-3N0-1MO and approaches to their treatment. An optimal algorithm of examination and treatment of the above patients with consideration of the disease stage and somatic status is proposed.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
